{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wgc-e-1-e26","title":"为俭钦所迫胁者悉归降","order":5520,"accounts":[{"id":"wgc-a-1-e26","label":"正文","text":"为俭钦所迫胁者悉归降","evidence":["wgc-q0238","wgc-q0020"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原纪年逐项对读；不从邻段继承绝对年份。","evidence":["wgc-q0238","wgc-q0020"]},"ordering_evidence":"wgc-q0238"}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0020","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-b304e7f72ba4a233d484","layer":"original","quote":"大将军纵骁骑追击，大破之，钦遁走。是日，俭闻钦战败，恐惧夜走，众溃。比至慎县〖6〗，左右人兵稍弃俭去〖7〗；俭独与小弟秀及孙重，藏水边草中。安风津都尉部民张属就射杀俭〖8〗，传首京都。属封侯。秀、重，走入吴〖9〗。将士诸为俭、钦所迫胁者，悉归降。﹝二﹞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":126,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0238","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-b304e7f72ba4a233d484","layer":"original","quote":"将士诸为俭、钦所迫胁者，悉归降","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":107,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
